OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to rebuild unsafe school
OL,4,Asubmitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to demolish and rebuild a primary
OL,7,Fschool in Leicester that was found to
OL,8,Fhave crumbling concrete and asbestos
OL,9,Fhave been lodged.
OL,11,FThe Department for Education and Morgan
OL,12,FSindall Construction have applied to
OL,13,FLeicester City Council for permission
OL,14,Fto reconstruct Parks Primary School in
OL,15,Fthe west end of the city.
OL,17,FThe 1950s building was abruptly closed
OL,18,Fin June 2023 after inspections found
OL,19,FReinforced Autoclaved Aerated Concrete
OL,20,F(RAAC) planks in a "highly critical
OL,21,Fcondition".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
