OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to rebuild unsafe school
OL,4,Asubmitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FPupils were relocated to nearby
OL,7,Fcouncil-owned buildings and a
OL,8,Fchildren's centre before temporary
OL,9,Fclassrooms were set up on the school
OL,10,Fplaying field.
